      "Elevated serum prolactin due to stalk effect",
      "Hyponatremia due to secondary adrenal insufficiency"
    ],
    "imaging": [
      "MRI pituitary showing homogeneous enlargement of anterior pituitary",
      "Pituitary stalk thickening and enhancement",
      "Absence of cystic or necrotic areas differentiating from adenoma"
    ],
